      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "On 20 December 2011, the European Commission published legislative proposals for the revised public procurement directives and a new concessions directive. This PPN cascades the announcement to UK stakeholders and invites comments on the proposals to inform Cabinet Office’s negotiating position.",
